    """注 root_a(DK11 net_delay_x_inv_latency, DEP-half): kubectl set env deploy/inventory FAULT_DELAY_MS=<delay_ms>
    → inventory before_request 进程内 sleep(app-latency, inventory_service/app.py L116/L145 已有 hook, 无源码改动)。
    injected_at 取【carrier(inventory_direct)稳定观测到延迟态】时刻(见 _wait_carrier_slow: rollout/port-forward ~50s 滞后, 不用 rollout status 返回时刻)。
    观测 victim = inventory_direct = GET /api/inventory/{item}(纯 SELECT 只读, 绝不碰 reserve/release 写端点)。返回 injected_at ISO Z。"""
